<title>USA: DuPont Korea employee named Nonwoven head.</title>
<headline>DuPont Korea employee named Nonwoven head.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Nonwovens said Thursday that D.S. Kim took over global leadership resonsibilities for the business as of March 1.</p>
<p>The DuPont Co subsidiary said the DuPont Korea employee replaced Siegfried K. Wittauer, who retired at the end of February after holding the position since 1990.</p>
<p>Kim, 49, was previously operations director for Fluoroproducts. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
